bevy_audio 0.19.1 (https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy, MIT OR Apache-2.0), vendored and modified for the
Scooby-Doo! Mystery Mayhem PC port: src/audio_output.rs (AudioOutput made public; the default output stream
is opened with an error callback that flags a lost device, plus is_available/is_lost/close/reopen) and
src/lib.rs (re-export). All other files are unchanged from the crates.io release.
